SY_TALK("uEuLmlBvS6A",[[38,["This falls on the day of famous great full moon,"]],[48,["it is called as Sharada Indu, that's the name of the Goddess also"]],[56,["Sharada Indu; the moon on this autumn season."]],[62,["This is the biggest moon, and - of course not in England,"]],[71,["but in India - that day the moon is giving the greatest light,"]],[79,["and it's such a great thing that Guru Nanaka was born on such a day."]],[88,["As you know in India people celebrate birthdays"]],[95,["according to dates of the moon, called as tithi"]],[100,["not as the dates we have here according to the sun."]],[133,["This great personality was born in Punjab"]],[140,["where people were unaware of God's ways."]],[153,["He was always bothered about the Dharma in all his lives,"]],[166,["because as you know he was the Primal Master,"]],[170,["and the Primal Master is always placed"]],[179,["in looking after our Void,"]],[182,["in sustaining us, and giving us a model of an ideal master."]],[189,["And he always took birth either in the most difficult places"]],[199,["like hills and dales and mountains, or they took places --"]],[204,["which are even more difficult thing, among the people who were horrid,"]],[212,["and who needed their help."]],[215,["So in India, that time somehow Punjab was regarded as the place"]],[223,["where people did not respect God or traditional Hindu idols,"]],[236,["or you can say the statues that were regarded as the vibrating ones."]],[248,["But they worshipped money (even now)"]],[254,["and they worshipped power."]],[260,["And as at that time there was a King who was very anxious"]],[271,["to convert people to Islamic Religion by giving them money,"]],[276,["many were taking to Islam."]],[280,["As a result the Hindus started hating the muslims"]],[286,["and a big hatred developed among Muslims and Hindus."]],[294,["That's how, in those circumstances where there was a quarrel going on"]],[300,["between the followers of Mohammad and followers of Hinduism,"]],[305,["Mohammad himself took his birth on this earth,"]],[309,["though he had decided not to take any more births,"]],[314,["he thought that it would solve the problem."]],[317,["Although, this incarnation is such that it never dies."]],[322,["Even if they leave the body, they are always around."]],[335,["And they are the ones who perform lots of miracles"]],[340,["when any other incarnation comes on this earth."]],[345,["They help support and guide the seekers"]],[349,["to go to the incarnations."]],[351,["So, to celebrate his birthday"]],[356,["on such a date is also a myth,"]],[363,["because he never died. He is eternally living."]],[367,["They never grow and they never die."]],[372,["But his birth is important,"]],[376,["because symbolically he came on this earth"]],[381,["not to propogate any particular type of the void --"]],[389,["as Mohammad did or say Moses did, and before that Abraham,"]],[395,["Lao Tse, or Socrates - which followed into a religion."]],[408,["But he came to create amity - we can say, to create understanding,"]],[415,["to create unity between religions."]],[418,["This was a very big step for Sahaja Yoga."]],[422,["After that as you know, he was born again - God knows where --"]],[428,["no one knows where he was born, but he appeared as Shirdi Sai Nath."]],[433,["He too said the same thing, that to talk ill of any religion is a sin."]],[440,["But these efforts are quite lost."]],[453,["Because the people who were Islamic at that time,"]],[459,["or those who were Hindus, are now very great fanatics."]],[466,["So instead of them coming closer and loving each other"]],[471,["they have become fanatics."]],[481,["Though we find that Islam is spreading so fast"]],[486,["Sikhism is spreading very fast too."]],[489,["In America there is a horrible guru he has started to spread Sikhism."]],[495,["He's converting all the white skinned people into Sikhs."]],[499,["They are growing their hair, and they are also growing their beard,"]],[505,["and wearing a kara and all those five things"]],[509,["that were required at the time of Guru Gobind Singh."]],[512,["When the war had started they had to wear all these things,"]],[516,["which was important."]],[518,["Because war had started and to protect Hinduism or Hindus"]],[526,["from the invasion of the Muslims --"]],[529,["the fanaticism of the Muslims --"]],[532,["they took to this kind of a military stuff."]],[538,["Actually if you believe in God - nothing can be killed."]],[542,["But I think that Guru Gobind thought that he had to take it."]],[548,["In all these prophetic religions, if you see, all the prophets"]],[551,["who have spread all the religions, they were always attacked so badly"]],[555,["that they had to take to weapons."]],[558,["Even in Islam they had to take to weapons to protect themselves."]],[563,["Now when these people took to weapons"]],[564,["they had some discipline put on the people."]],[569,["Without the discipline nothing is possible."]],[574,["And very strict discipline was there for the Sikhs."]],[578,["Now today's Sikhs are no more Sikhs,"]],[581,["they are just outside, and inside they are not."]],[590,["I would not describe all the strictness and discipline"]],[595,["they had to go through. But every disciple has to go"]],[605,["through a very severe disciplining of himself"]],[610,["if he has to become the Guru. There is no doubt about it."]],[616,["It is not that only somebody like Me comes and tells you"]],[621,["do this do that, and next day you forget these things."]],[624,["It is very serious matter, one has to understand."]],[631,["You have got your realization through Sahaja Yoga"]],[633,["Now you have become Sahaja Yogis."]],[636,["But still I would say you are not full Sahaja Yogis"]],[641,["because every Sahaja Yogi has to be a Guru"]],[644,["Otherwise he is not a Sahaja Yogi."]],[646,["First of all you are Yogis because you got your realisation."]],[653,["But Yogis are of no use, you have to be Sahaja Yogis."]],[657,["So you were told about all the chakras,"]],[660,["every thing that you are doing, about all the problems of Kundalini"]],[668,["how to cure them. Everything about it was told to you."]],[671,["Now you became, with that, a different type of a race,"]],[680,["a different type of people, who are twice-born,"]],[684,["who are born by the Spirit, not by the flesh."]],[689,["Remember that that's a very important point and which John has said."]],[693,["That you are born by the Spirit not by the flesh."]],[697,["Those who are born by the flesh are in flesh."]],[700,["But if you are born by the Spirit, that's how you are twice born."]],[705,["And when you know all about the Spirit and the Kundalini"]],[710,["then you are a Sahaja Yogi."]],[712,["But unless and until you become Guru,"]],[715,["you are not a full Sahaja Yogi."]],[719,["So to begin with, we must understand that the Spirit is described"]],[725,["as a Kala, a a phase of Moon, one phase of moon."]],[730,["But a Guru is described as the full moon - purnima -Guru Purnima."]],[735,["Guru is the full moon, it's not just a phase."]],[740,["So from one phase you have to go to the stage"]],[746,["where you become a complete Guru."]],[749,["16 phases there are altogether,"]],[753,["and you have ro cross the 16 stages to become the Guru."]],[760,["Now how do we do it?"]],[763,["We have to become extremely objective about it."]],[767,["How do we become the Guru?"]],[768,["Because we have to become Gurus, no doubt."]],[770,["Now you cannot just say that, Mother you give us a tape"]],[774,["and we'll learn by heart and we'll go on to another person"]],[777,["saying blah blah blah blah blah."]],[779,["Same thing, whetever I've told you, or take my type"]],[782,["and show them that this is our Mother,"]],[785,["and She's like this and like that. But they will say alright"]],[791,["She may be, but what about you. Sir ?"]],[795,["Now Sahaja Yoga has a 'very' big responsibility,"]],[800,["which I don't think people understand."]],[802,["I wish they could listen to me very intensely and understand it."]],[808,["So far if you see. Gurus remained Gurus"]],[813,["and no disciples became Gurus."]],[818,["They were still regarded as disciples of a Guru,"]],[820,["whether it was fake or anything."]],[824,["They never became Gurus themselves."]],[827,["So there was no need for them to grow,"]],[830,["they had to take the name of their Guru alright."]],[834,["Christ and his disciples, Mohammad Sahib had his own disciples."]],[839,["Nanaka had his own disciples, Shirdi Sai Nath had his own disciples."]],[845,["None of them became Gurus."]],[848,["But now it is in your lot, sorry to say,"]],[852,["that you have to become the Gurus."]],[856,["It's a privilege, actually."]],[859,["It's a very great privilege to become the Guru."]],[862,["And to become the Guru, we must learn what we have to do."]],[868,["This also sometimes becomes just a lecture. I think so."]],[873,["Because I've already told you on Guru Purnima"]],[876,["what are the 10 attainments we have to have."]],[879,["Today all these 16 stages are to be seen,"]],[884,["how we have to grow into a Guru."]],[890,["First is, we have complete discipline put on ourselves."]],[900,["Like Mr Nick is attacked by everyone."]],[905,["No, you attack yourself. You become Mr Nick now."]],[912,["You have to make this body subservient to you,"]],[917,["that is the first mastery."]],[920,["The mastery is that my body can sleep anywhere,"]],[924,["it can starve itself, it can live under any circumstances,"]],[930,["it dare not grudge."]],[932,["Anywhere; it should be able to sleep any time,"]],[937,["it should be able to keep awake anytime."]],[940,["This body is to be mastered."]],[943,["Even if you read 'Ashtanga Yoga'"]],[946,["first thing is mastery over the body, they say."]],[948,["So after realisation the first thing you have to do"]],[952,["is master this body,"]],[953,["and is the most difficult thing for western people;"]],[958,["because the matter is sitting on their Spirit."]],[962,["First the Spirit has to come - first phase --"]],[966,["at least the Spirit has to be there."]],[969,["If you have to be the Spirit then thematter of moon"]],[976,["has to be covered with that light."]],[979,["In the first phase we have to master our body."]],[982,["So what do we do to master our body ?"]],[987,["First of all we must see that what are the things"]],[991,["that drain out our bodily mastery."]],[997,["We must know all the crooks who try to master us."]],[1002,["So I have to first face my body."]],[1029,["That first and foremost thing in Sahaja Yoga we learn"]],[1035,["that we have to respect our body."]],[1038,["This is the first principle of respecting our body."]],[1043,["Means indulgence is sinful to the body,"]],[1046,["because indulgence gives you a body which is no good:"]],[1054,["First of all you must respect your body"]],[1057,["so that you can master it."]],[1060,["If I do not respect you, I cannot master you."]],[1062,["So to master the body first of all respect your body."]],[1067,["And to respect your body, you must look after your body very well."]],[1074,["But no indulgence."]],[1076,["That doesn't mean that you go and stand in the mud"]],[1079,["or rain for hours together or get exposed,"]],[1084,["to make your body absolutely sort of a abode for all the diseases"]],[1092,["and colds and coughs and things like that"]],[1094,["so your Mother suffers cleaning your vishuddhi!"]],[1103,["It's like a horse whose neck is down."]],[1108,["So you must look after your body by hot giving it diseases."]],[1113,["Laziness is against it."]],[1116,["Persons who are lazy must know"]],[1118,["that laziness is against your body."]],[1121,["Lazy people who are not bothered to dress up properly,"]],[1125,["to cover themselves up properly, look after their body properly,"]],[1130,["put oil into different screws that they have, to massage themselves."]],[1138,["Look after the body, that's the point."]],[1141,["To look after the body you must give some time,"]],[1144,["because this body is the temple of God."]],[1147,["And now you have become the temple"]],[1149,["but if the temple is dirty,"]],[1151,["is sick, is unimpressive, is like a stick, or like a balloon,"]],[1160,["nobody is going to come near it."]],[1165,["So try to improve your personality,"]],[1169,["that it has to be a beautiful temple."]],[1175,["I mean, I have given you so many tips, that I think"]],[1179,["that in my lives' time I have not given so many tips, even as Guru."]],[1184,["Because normally people who came to a Guru in those days"]],[1187,["were really, really great seekers."]],[1190,["They would hang themselves upside down, just to please the Guru,"]],[1194,["for months together."]],[1199,["So that was a very different quality people -- but one or two."]],[1204,["And when you have quantity quality goes down, I accept."]],[1207,["But why not you people take it upon yourselves"]],[1211,["that we'll make our quality first class ?"]],[1213,["So first of all train up your body well."]],[1218,["You must take some exercises in the morning, I have told you."]],[1222,["That people sleep after breakfast I am told,"]],[1225,["I was amazed. I mean, this is too much."]],[1229,["You see, God has given you this house as a blessing,"]],[1237,["to be more alert, to give His light to others."]],[1243,["Instead of that if the candle is not even flickering what's the use."]],[1253,["So what you have to do is to first of all brush up, yourself, completely."]],[1260,["Make your body alright, alert."]],[1263,["Actually at your age one should not sleep"]],[1266,["for more than six or seven hours, I tell you. No need."]],[1271,["Six or seven hours of deep sleep is sufficient."]],[1276,["I also, in the night I sleep about --"]],[1279,["never before eleven sometimes at twelve,"]],[1282,["Yesterday we slept at 20'clock, got up at 5. 30 as usual."]],[1286,["So how many ? Three and a half hours sleep."]],[1289,["And just now I slept for about at the most for half an hour"]],[1293,["or an hour or so finished."]],[1295,["When you don't have to work, like me,"]],[1301,["in the sense that even when I sleep I am working."]],[1306,["So to rest your body for such a long time"]],[1309,["you make your body sit on your head"]],[1311,["and it will be very very difficult for you to be alert."]],[1317,["So first of all body must be looked after."]],[1321,["There should be no self-indulgence."]],[1324,["I mean it can go to any extent of self indulgence."]],[1327,["Like people don't keep their rooms clean, their clothes clean,"]],[1330,["they have no activities - all these nonsensical things,"]],[1334,["only it is too low, too base to talk about; but it happens."]],[1338,["People can go to any base limit - you know,"]],[1341,["that's the problem, what to do?"]],[1344,["On this full moon day one has to realize"]],[1349,["that on a full moon day you are over-active."]],[1352,["As the moon starts growing the activity starts."]],[1355,["In the night also."]],[1358,["But none of you so far"]],[1361,["are active in the night except for me."]],[1364,["But if you come up you will be surprised,"]],[1367,["even in your sleep you will be active."]],[1372,["So first and foremost thing is that you must look after your body."]],[1377,["The body should be presentable."]],[1380,["And should not go with the so-called fashions of the day."]],[1387,["It is very important."]],[1389,["One should not go with the fashions of the day,"]],[1394,["and take to something which is nonsensical,"]],[1397,["which is not good for your appearance,"]],[1402,["which makes you look funny or very fashionable"]],[1406,["like a dandy person."]],[1408,["We have to wear a dress which is in the centre, dignified, which is good."]],[1419,["Now I'm told that it is very difficult even to wake up in England."]],[1425,["Somebody had told me, when I was young,"]],[1428,["that don't wake up an Englishman."]],[1432,["I haven't tried that, even with a barge pole."]],[1437,["I just tell you at this time, never in the morning time."]],[1441,["Because I've been warned: never wake up an Englishman,"]],[1443,["that is the greatest sin on this earth!"]],[1452,["So why should the English be so much addicted to sleep!"]],[1457,["The whole country is sleeping today."]],[1460,["They want more wages, more wages so that they can sleep more."]],[1466,["Eat and drink, drink and eat in between, sleep."]],[1470,["This is the three - programmed life."]],[1478,["It was very difficult, from the very beginnig"]],[1482,["I saw Sahaja Yogis coming, in that to wake them up was difficult."]],[1487,["And these are the same people who were known for punctuality"]],[1493,["that they won the war at Waterloo because of punctuality,"]],[1498,["and they were so punctual that people used to set their watches --"]],[1504,["even in America. They are the same people."]],[1507,["Now the other side of it is that they sleep like log of wood."]],[1512,["They used to sleep before also must be, because this is an old saying that."]],[1515,["Don't wake up an Englishman."]],[1517,["But I used to think something else about it why it is said,"]],[1521,["but it is nothing but simple laziness."]],[1526,["So try to see why we sleep so much."]],[1536,["If the left side is strong, people sleep."]],[1542,["If the back Agnya is strong, people sleep."]],[1546,["If the front Agnya is working too much"]],[1553,["then people don't sleep."]],[1558,["So even if I say, \"Don't sleep\","]],[1561,["it mean that you put your right Agnya in working condition,"]],[1566,["that means you start thinking."]],[1569,["Which is against Sahaja Yoga again."]],[1572,["So it would be left agnya, right agnya, right agnya, left agnya,"]],[1574,["left agnya, left agnya, right agnya, left agnya..."]],[1576,["It will be going from one to another."]],[1580,["So in the centre you have to be with Christ."]],[1593,["He is alert every second of the day;"]],[1603,["killing; beating, hitting,"]],[1608,["curing, looking after, guiding."]],[1615,["Twenty four hours a day. And go and ask any realized soul"]],[1624,["who is called as Avadhuta, the one who is a master,"]],[1627,["they will tell you they hardly sleep for three hours or four hours."]],[1632,["Because they cannot work when they are sleeping,"]],[1636,["so they sleep for four hours,"]],[1637,["the rest of the time they are working:"]],[1640,["either they meditate and do things by projection,"]],[1645,["or they work with their hands."]],[1648,["They are busy people, they are very busy."]],[1652,["You have to be very busy people because now you are employed by God."]],[1660,["And you have to do full justice to this employment by working hard."]],[1666,["On the contrary you have seen that it is very easy to get lazy."]],[1678,["So now, as many of you are already feeling sleepy, put your...."]],[1683,["First thing should be for all those people who are lazy,"]],[1687,["is to put their right to the left seven times -"]],[1690,["let's have it."]],[1694,["With the right hand...."]],[1711,["It's better? Now the back Agnya."]],[1717,["Let's have it."]],[1721,["Laziness is first. Shri Krishna was against laziness."]],[1728,["Anywhere he got a chance he talked against laziness, Alasya."]],[1735,["Now watch me."]],[1738,["On the photograph you can do the same...."]],[1798,["Better now?"]],[1804,["Tonight we have to keep awake; it's a big problem."]],[1809,["But don't sleep formally here. Alright ?"]],[1812,["Informally you can."]],[1828,["Better ?"]],[1833,["Put your eyes, try Again."]],[1868,["So the mastery should be, first of all, of your body."]],[1874,["Say, you are sleeping on one side, you get a pain --"]],[1877,["then what do you do? You sleep on the other side."]],[1881,["In the same way, this body is to be made"]],[1885,["immune to different shocks,"]],[1889,["you see. Like you put the watch in the water."]],[1893,["You shock it with the water, so it is waterproof."]],[1897,["So a Sahaja Yogi has to be an all-proofed person."]],[1901,["So he has no place to complain,"]],[1911,["because he's supposed to be all-proof, you see."]],[1914,["Anybody (Sahaja Yogi) who complains, you can say,"]],[1917,["\"How are you complaining?"]],[1918,["Because you have to be all-proof.\""]],[1922,["So no complaints of any kind, of Sahaja Yogis"]],[1932,["are to be accepted or sympathized."]],[1940,["If you start accepting people who are complaining type"]],[1946,["you will be always busy looking after them,"]],[1948,["and you will be of no use to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1954,["Those who have habits of complaininig and all that"]],[1957,["should go to the hospital and stay there."]],[1960,["Complaining people are really people"]],[1964,["who have some sort of possession,"]],[1967,["I think, that they all the time complain and try to torture you,"]],[1971,["and make a nuisance out of themselves."]],[1974,["Such people cannot become Gurus."]],[1977,["Imagine - if the Guru is complaining then what is he going to teach?"]],[1982,["Only complaining."]],[1984,["The teachers will be expert in complaining"]],[1987,["and the students will be also experts in complaining."]],[1990,["So you create a set of complaining disciples, you see,"]],[1996,["And when they come to Me what I find"]],[1998,["they all have double lists than yourselves about their complaints."]],[2004,["But also it is very characteristic."]],[2006,["Like Australians seldom complain,"]],[2009,["and if they do complain they are hit also very badly."]],[2012,["Seldom you will find an Australian complaining."]],[2015,["I have got letters - except one or two"]],[2018,["who have now found themselves out - seldom"]],[2021,["they complain about themselves, about their body comforts,"]],[2026,["this thing that thing. So under any circumstances"]],[2029,["those who can live are the people"]],[2035,["who have achieved the one sixteenth,"]],[2038,["only the one sixteenth."]],[2039,["(Jaise rakhahu taise hi rahu)"]],[2042,["Mother the way you keep it we are willing to stay."]],[2046,["Of course the Mother has kept you very well."]],[2053,["All the luxuries of world Mother has given you."]],[2057,["She doesn't torture you like other Gurus have tortured."]],[2061,["Once and for all."]],[2063,["My Son has gone through all the tortures,"]],[2067,["there is no need to put you to any tortures or troubles."]],[2072,["But you should see how your body reacts,"]],[2074,["and tell your body, \"Yes Mr body, will you please now,"]],[2079,["behave yourself and not try to be indulgent.\""]],[2084,["All these indulgences come to us through our senses."]],[2091,["So if you can master your body"]],[2094,["you will also master your senses."]],[2097,["For example the master, or we say the highest of the organs"]],[2108,["which controls most of the organs, I personally think, is the tongue."]],[2112,["Because it's the primordial nonsense."]],[2120,["By tongue we speak things to hurt others."]],[2127,["With tongue we learn how to go on jabbering."]],[2132,["With tongue we can show how frivolous we are."]],[2137,["Either we are tongue tied or tongue - loose,"]],[2141,["there's nothing in between with the tongue."]],[2143,["That's only about talking part, that's lower."]],[2146,["But when it comes higher, eating;"]],[2152,["all the time thinking about eating."]],[2154,["I have told you a hundred times, that Sahaja Yogis should go"]],[2157,["on really sometimes on absolutely bland boiled horrible food --"]],[2164,["just to test the tongue. Do it, try this, then try this."]],[2171,["My father used to tell that you must burn your tongue a little bit."]],[2176,["That's one of the tests he said one should do."]],[2178,["But he was a hard taskmaster as a Guru."]],[2181,["So we should see what our tongue can bear,"]],[2185,["is it fussy about food ?"]],[2193,["When it sees the food does it start watering, first of all;"]],[2202,["does it take our attention to food,"]],[2206,["is food important to us?"]],[2208,["So the first thing, to overcome the problem of your tongue is"]],[2220,["\"to starve.\" Starvation is the only way"]],[2225,["you can correct yourself. You see if you starve yourself --"]],[2229,["say, morning just have little to eat, reduce it to half."]],[2235,["You'll be surprised your intestine will be halved also."]],[2238,["After some time you cannot eat more even if you want to."]],[2242,["Your interest will go off. Train up yourself."]],[2246,["Starvation is a very good thing."]],[2248,["I think 40 days that Christ did is a very good idea."]],[2254,["But that should not be a kind of a thing that like - they have Ramazan,"]],[2260,["that they eat the most s..... food during that time early in the morning"]],[2265,["then the whole day they starve - thinking about food!"]],[2271,["Starve yourself fully and don't think about food."]],[2277,["That's difficult so starve yourself  in halfway"]],[2280,["and dont think about food."]],[2283,["Gradually try to master your tongue."]],[2286,["Mastery of your tongue is only possible if you know"]],[2290,["how to starve your day. This is for the western side."]],[2293,["For eastern side they fast morning till evening."]],[2298,["I know one lady, if you ask them they say"]],[2301,["\"I observe Monday, I observe Tuesday, I observe Wednesday,"]],[2305,["I observe Thursday, I observe Friday a fast,"]],[2308,["and perhaps maybe if I do not starve Saturday I will eat on Sunday.\""]],[2315,["I have know such people in my life time - many --"]],[2319,["who just go on fasting."]],[2321,["They are such experts and astute? you see,"]],[2324,["that they can show you that they can fast for 50 days, 80 days,"]],[2328,["108 days, and 300 days."]],[2333,["Starving masters."]],[2335,["So for them I have to tell, \"you have to eat'', when they are starve."]],[2339,["To you I have to say,"]],[2341,["\"Let us see which day we can starve ourselves.\""]],[2344,["Let us have one day to celebrate today's great day of Nanaka!"]],[2351,["One day let us starve. Which day should we?"]],[2357,["Monday we cannot because Monday we have a programme,"]],[2363,["Tuesday we cannot because it is a day when Hanuman has to work,"]],[2372,["Wednesday we cannot, because then the creativity takes place,"]],[2377,["Thursday we cannot because we are Guru at that day,"]],[2380,["we have to work very hard as Gurus, Friday we cannot,"]],[2383,["we have to work the shakti of Mother,"]],[2386,["Saturday we cannot because we have to do"]],[2388,["all the intrigue of Shri Krishna."]],[2393,["And Sunday how can it be, this is the day of the sun!\""]],[2399,["So which is the best day for starving, now let us see."]],[2404,["We should have Thursday, because Thursday is the Guru's day"]],[2410,["and let us do some fasting, half day, half day can we?"]],[2415,["Can we start with half day then f... day?"]],[2418,["Thursday let us have, maybe second half"]],[2421,["because breakfast is essential I think."]],[2425,["Without breakfast you see, the horses cannot whinny,"]],[2431,["so let us have the second half"]],[2436,["or we can have the first half."]],[2439,["Actually you have to discipline yourself, if you have to be the Gurus."]],[2445,["It's like going to a college,"]],[2448,["when you are left to yourself,"]],[2450,["it is you, who has to discipline yourself,"]],[2453,["nobody has to tell you that you do this and do that"]],[2456,["That's the measure to wake you up."]],[2458,["In India it is the other way around."]],[2461,["If you tell somebody that you have to wake up at 5,"]],[2465,["the person who has told you will be awakened at 4 o' clock himself,"]],[2470,["the one who has told; so that he doesn't get up to wake him up."]],[2475,["Did you follow me?"]],[2478,["And the whole house will be awakened at 4 o'clock"]],[2481,["so that they can take up the duty from the person"]],[2484,["who has to get awakened."]],[2488,["But the fellow who has to awaken"]],[2489,["might not sleep the whole night."]],[2492,["It is just the other way round, the other extreme of it."]],[2496,["Say if I am there, one night I sleep there. If I get up"]],[2503,["at one o'clock I find all of them sitting and meditating,"]],[2506,["in the passage, up to the bathroom everywhere."]],[2509,["They have not gone home, not taken food, nothing."]],[2512,["Just meditating, taking vibrations, correcting."]],[2515,["I am sleeping inside."]],[2516,["In the night I want to go to the bathroom,"]],[2519,["I just cannot go because they are all meditating."]],[2521,["Nobody is sleeping, nobody is sleeping."]],[2529,["So it is the other way around."]],[2533,["So to you people let us do one day."]],[2535,["That you must have one day fasting, one day keeping, one awake."]],[2541,["Which day should it be? Let's see."]],[2547,["A day when there is no film!"]],[2557,["Half night, second half I mean, not the first half."]],[2568,["Which day? Which is the most difficult day when you cannot,"]],[2582,["cannot keep awake. Sunday night;"]],[2590,["but there's a fiIm on!"]],[2596,["Without the film, you see!"]],[2599,["Treat yourself like that, joke with yourself,"]],[2602,["now Sunday night is there a film on?"]],[2605,["After 12 there isn't."]],[2607,["So Sunday night you get up at 12 o'clock."]],[2609,["Let's have it. Enjoy it. Don't get angry."]],[2618,["Make a fun out of it."]],[2623,["You think more about it, then you get upset."]],[2628,["You just don't think about it, then you'll enjoy it."]],[2630,["It's like swimming."]],[2631,["Get up at 12 o'clock, all of you, go for a bath, sit down,"]],[2636,["sing Bhajans, this, that, let us do it. Should we ?"]],[2644,["Michel, What happen with you?"]],[2647,["\"I can go to bed at two o clock\""]],[2654,["You have to get up at 12 o'clock,"]],[2658,["you have to go to bed till 12 o'clock."]],[2662,["Get up at 12 o'clock."]],[2664,["You see the first half of the night, one must sleep always, it's better."]],[2668,["Second half of the night is the better part, alright?"]],[2672,["So the first half of the night you all have to sleep, anytime."]],[2676,["You can sleep about 8 o'clock or 9 o'clock if you want to."]],[2681,["But that should not be important, what time you sleep,"]],[2684,["you have to get up at 12 o'clock in the morning,"]],[2688,["or say after 12."]],[2694,["Shri Krishna was born in the night about 12 o'clock."]],[2697,["Nanaka was born 12 o'clock in the night."]],[2700,["All the Gurus mostly took their birth at 12 o'clock in the night."]],[2705,["To celebrate that, we must have one day when we do not sleep after 12."]],[2711,["But then what about Caxton Hall!"]],[2715,["\"Mother we can try this on Saturday."]],[2718,["¿What?"]],[2720,["¿Can we do it in Saturday night? It will be more safe"]],[2723,["because will be less incidents the Sunday that Monday\""]],[2726,["Alright so you can sleep in the day time of Saturday or of Sunday."]],[2734,["Sunday afternoon you can sleep."]],[2736,["No, no, no that won't be alright."]],[2741,["If you make any compensation"]],[2744,["then you are not torturing your body much!"]],[2748,["You must devise a method by which"]],[2751,["your body does see that it has to get up at 12 o'clock,"]],[2754,["Better keep it that time."]],[2755,["What do you think ? Alright."]],[2758,["\"¿Do you think that this may affect the job on Monday?\""]],[2762,["¿What he said?"]],[2764,["\"That the job of the people may be affected"]],[2766,["on Monday morning, Mother\"."]],[2768,["They will never, take it from me, they will not:"]],[2773,["You see work is not important what is important"]],[2776,["is your Spirit, your mastery."]],[2781,["Work, in any case you're not going to have after some time,"]],[2785,["so that work is not important."]],[2788,["This new work that you have taken, better look after that."]],[2791,["Forget about your work. Forget about these things."]],[2795,["What is important is your Spirit."]],[2798,["Otherwise you cannot become Gurus."]],[2801,["Spirit is the most important thing."]],[2803,["The rest of the things are absolutely unimportant,"]],[2806,["a zero."]],[2811,["I've been very slowly trying to take you out"]],[2816,["of the mud of materialism and of these mundane things."]],[2821,["But you have to work for God. You are special people."]],[2827,["So, you have to make yourself a master,"]],[2834,["so God gives you all the blessings, everything."]],[2840,["But the idea of luxurious life must be given up."]],[2844,["People want to make this life luxurious,"]],[2848,["then you'll have the luxury of this world"]],[2851,["but not the luxury of God's blessings."]],[2855,["One of the two you have to select."]],[2857,["Either you lead a life which is luxurious on the material level,"]],[2870,["or you lead a luxurious life of God's blessings."]],[2874,["One of the two you have to choose, the time has come."]],[2878,["So nothing is important you see,"]],[2881,["the insecurity of money also is another nonsense."]],[2885,["At least you people should not have it."]],[2888,["I mean you will never starve at least,"]],[2890,["but Indians if they do not work they will starve."]],[2896,["But you people can never starve, if you are unemployed,"]],[2899,["government is happy more, as long as you don't bother them."]],[2905,["If you sit at home and meditate"]],[2908,["they'll be very happy."]],[2911,["So to earn more money or to make more money"]],[2916,["is not important at all in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2920,["Most important thing is to be the Spirit."]],[2923,["For that whatever is to be done has to be done."]],[2926,["Let everything suffer, you don't make your Spirit suffer."]],[2935,["Because you have to become the full moon, like Guru Nanak."]],[2944,["How much did Guru Nanak earn?"]],[2952,["You should find out, how did he live his life ?"]],[2965,["There is nothing to bother about money,"]],[2971,["because more money is not needed."]],[2977,["Just needed for your food and your living."]],[2983,["And then money is arranged if you need"]],[2986,["any extra money sometimes, emergencies."]],[2988,["I've done it for many Australians, you know."]],[2991,["But those are the people who have dedicated themselves fully."]],[2997,["And that is why they have been helped,"]],[3000,["whenever there is an emergency they don't have to bother."]],[3003,["But the dedication to your Spirit has to be full, complete,"]],[3008,["and nothing to your work, actually."]],[3013,["Because that goes hand in hand."]],[3016,["If you are not worried about yourself after realisation,"]],[3022,["about your Spirit, you'll have all the problems of the world."]],[3026,["First and foremost is financial problems."]],[3035,["Then, physical problem, mental problem, emotional problem."]],[3044,["All kinds of problems will follow,"]],[3046,["because I've awakened your Kundalini; one part I've done."]],[3051,["But another part that is your heart, you have not opened."]],[3054,["You must give your heart to Sahaja Yoga."]],[3057,["You have not opened your heart as yet."]],[3060,["Heart has to be opened."]],[3063,["You are still woried about your father, mother,"]],[3066,["brother, sister, wife, children."]],[3068,["Open your heart fully to Sahaja Yoga."]],[3075,["In a doubtless way."]],[3078,["Then only doubt less awareness will settle down."]],[3081,["Unless and until you open your heart,"]],[3084,["Kundalini rising has no meaning."]],[3086,["Because the Kundalini is rising but the heart has not opened."]],[3091,["If the Mother Earth sends forth her power through the seed"]],[3096,["and the seed doesn't open, then what's the use ?"]],[3099,["It's all a myth."]],[3100,["Open your heart to Sahaja Yoga."]],[3103,["Open your heart to Spirit, and say,"]],[3106,["\"Mother we are the Spirit.\""]],[3110,["You have to realize this,"]],[3111,["many people also perhaps do no realize"]],[3113,["that you have come on this earth to be the Spirit"]],[3117,["and not to be workers of human beings."]],[3122,["You must understand your greatness and know"]],[3128,["that you are not like mundan people. That's why you are blessed."]],[3133,["Who is blessed so much ?"]],[3135,["You are described long time back by Blake,"]],[3138,["that such and such people are going to come on this earth"]],[3141,["\"men of God.\" Men of God."]],[3145,["What do you have in your heart?"]],[3150,["Your heart will be like a stone."]],[3154,["Unless and until there is light of the Spirit"]],[3157,["it is a stone heart,"]],[3159,["and this stone is going to hurt everyone, is going to ruin you completely."]],[3168,["Open your heart hundred percent."]],[3177,["You have met Indian Sahaja Yogis,"]],[3181,["they have problems of money."]],[3183,["And how much they work for Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3187,["day in and day out how much they have contributed for Sahaja Yoga."]],[3193,["You can imagine, about 7 lakhs of rupees they have collected,"]],[3198,["Rustom knows. 7 lakhs of rupees, they have collected for their ashram."]],[3206,["7 lakhs is about £35000.£ 35000 they have collected only in Bombay."]],[3215,["In Delhi they have collected about 5 lakhs, £ 25000."]],[3222,["They are working, they have families they have children,"]],[3226,["but what they think about is nothing but Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3229,["nothing but Sahaja Yoga, nothing but Sahaja Yoga."]],[3238,["They give most of their money for Sahaja Yoga, I think."]],[3242,["They live with minimum."]],[3244,["If I tell them why don't you buy another shirt for yourself,"]],[3249,["they will say, \"Mother, I have worn lots of shirts in my previous life,\""]],[3258,["So satisfied ! \"We have found the Atma now,"]],[3261,["let us dress up the Atma."]],[3264,["We have found out our heart, let us become the heart\"."]],[3268,["What is the need to worry about these things ?"]],[3270,["We have done enough of all this nonsense."]],[3273,["I tell you they will think they are poor, but they are not."]],[3279,["Wherever they can save their money they will save it."]],[3283,["They used to give me some money before, I said,"]],[3285,["\"No I don't need just now, there's no need\""]],[3287,["They said I have no place to keep;"]],[3289,["there is no trust, nothing, how are we to do it?"]],[3292,["They continued like this till about, I think, in, 74,"]],[3306,["when I went back we thought of starting an ashram,"]],[3310,["because you people were all coming there."]],[3314,["So I said alright, now you have to give me money,"]],[3320,["all the Sahaja Yogis can give me money, whatever they have saved."]],[3324,["And you'll be amazed everyone came out with 1000 rupees,"]],[3327,["every one of them, whether he was a labourer or every one of them,"]],[3332,["1000 rupees minimum. Up to 21 000."]],[3337,["In 3 years time they had saved,"]],[3341,["because they thought it is our responsibility"]],[3342,["to save money for Sahaja Yoga."]],[3344,["Tomorrow if we have to have an ashram how are we going to have ?"]],[3352,["But we still indulge into things."]],[3362,["So this is what is the Gurupada."]],[3367,["This Sir has to sit down, make an space for him."]],[3372,["Come on, please. He doesn't need to be stand up. All right."]],[3380,["So today is such a great day of Guru Nanaka's birthday,"]],[3385,["and we have to see his own life, how he spent his own life,"]],[3389,["how he lived and in what conditions he managed."]],[3398,["So the first thing is to look after, disciplining yourself,"]],[3403,["feeling responsible for Sahaja Yoga."]],[3408,["I was amazed people told, me that in the ashram"]],[3412,["people keep the lights on, and the oil costs so much,"]],[3417,["300 pounds every week. I'm amazed!"]],[3423,["Every one of you should be responsi-be for every electricity,"]],[3427,["everything that you spend here. This is God's place."]],[3435,["Somebody has given the car, everybody wants to use the car."]],[3439,["You see this saving the pounds"]],[3441,["is still going on the heads of Sahaja Yogis."]],[3444,["If they can save by taking somebody's car they would borrow."]],[3448,["Never borrow anybody's car."]],[3449,["It's not for you, you must have your self respect,"]],[3451,["why to borrow anybody's car?"]],[3453,["It's not to be done."]],[3459,["So the second point of the Self is self respect."]],[3463,["First is the respect of your body,"]],[3467,["and the second is self-respect."]],[3473,["We are arrogant, we can be rude,"]],[3479,["but we have no self respect."]],[3490,["But it is the training that is lacking,"]],[3494,["you see suddenly I find after war"]],[3496,["there has been no teaching how to be self respecting."]],[3505,["Like in the war, might be, the atmosphere might have been created I don't know why - that-"]],[3510,["\"I´m above everything, don't care for others.\""]],[3515,["May have been; I don't know why this kind of a thing has come,"]],[3519,["but it is so. Very prevalent."]],[3521,["But you people have to be other way round:"]],[3524,["'Others are first and then yourself."]],[3527,["With your self respect."]],[3529,["Doesn't matter, nobody is going to die, I can tell you this much."]],[3539,["You all must have self respect; and such mediocre people"]],[3544,["should not be allowed to stay in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3550,["at least in the ashram, because it brings a bad name to all Sahaja Yoga."]],[3555,["One person can spoil the whole."]],[3557,["Only people who want to be Gurus have to stay in the ashram."]],[3562,["It's not going to be made a convenience for anyone."]],[3567,["But the other way around is that,"]],[3571,["\"We are going to look after ourselves,"]],[3573,["we have to become this, we have to grow,"]],[3576,["we have to do it.\""]],[3584,["Then it's just, the other way round, everything works out,"]],[3588,["I don't have to tell you."]],[3590,["You know this is so base and so gross"]],[3592,["that after being here for so many years,"]],[3595,["you should all have become avadhutas by now, absolutely."]],[3600,["Controlling all elements, everything, should have been possible;"]],[3603,["but stilI you are under the grip of the elements,"]],[3606,["how can you control it ?"]],[3615,["First of all get out of the slavery, this mental slavery."]],[3622,["\"Alright if it is there, it is there, if it is not there it doesn't matter."]],[3626,["Nothing is more important than me,"]],[3628,["I am the king of the whole world."]],[3630,["If I have to sleep on the ground I can sleep,"]],[3632,["if I have to sleep in the palaces I can sleep,"]],[3634,["nothing can dominate me.\" Then you are the master."]],[3640,["You know in India, there are some Sahaja Yogis"]],[3642,["who are controlling definitely controlling, elements."]],[3648,["We have examples of that, lots of things have been published"]],[3652,["you know in Nirmala Yoga, you must have heard."]],[3655,["But you meet them, you'll find they are avadhutas"]],[3658,["and when they talk you feel a great sage is talking,"]],[3660,["and the way they behave, all the time you see their behaviour"]],[3663,["and everything is so great."]],[3665,["We need people of that calibre today,"]],[3666,["because that is the situation of all nations."]],[3672,["You have to be extra-good, because today is not a time"]],[3677,["when we can allow things to go, as they are."]],[3684,["Or we are not just disciples,"]],[3687,["we all have to become gurus."]],[3692,["And it is not the time when you can play with time."]],[3696,["You cannot play with evil. You have to surmount it."]],[3702,["You have to come on top of it, it is the time"]],[3704,["when the whole ship is going to be drowned or saved."]],[3707,["This is the situation today."]],[3709,["And that's why you have got your realization from God."]],[3713,["If that precarious time had not arrived,"]],[3715,["how many of you really think you deserved it?"]],[3719,["But you got it, because the time is such that everybody"]],[3724,["must be given realization, and they must be given all powers"]],[3728,["so that they come up."]],[3730,["But if you do not open your heart,"]],[3732,["put all your attention to your Spirit,"]],[3734,["these powers will not work out."]],[3736,["None of these powers will work out in you."]],[3739,["This is the problem."]],[3741,["Every Guru had a command on the elements."]],[3745,["Nanaka, you know definitely."]],[3748,["People were sitting there and they asked him for the water"]],[3754,["and he put his hand on a rock and the water started pouring down."]],[3761,["That's why it is called Punjab, Punja :"]],[3765,["five; and the five rivers exist there, too."]],[3774,["It is said about all of them that they had powers over the elements."]],[3781,["So how much we are lacking ?"]],[3784,["Still we are like other people who are selling cheap things,"]],[3790,["or who are busy making cheap things, or who are of no value."]],[3799,["You are the ones who have to save the whole world."]],[3803,["And the maximum of my life, blood and toil and everything,"]],[3807,["sweat, I've put in this land of yours."]],[3810,["And the time is coming for me to go."]],[3813,["Only three years more are left; before that,"]],[3818,["I hope, we establish an ashram."]],[3821,["We need not pay for it,"]],[3822,["but, you have to be ready to occupy it,"]],[3827,["otherwise you cannot occupy it I can tell you,"]],[3829,["you cannot get any more blessings of God."]],[3832,["So why should God bless you ?"]],[3834,["This is the point one should ask oneself."]],[3836,["Are you your own Spirit or you are all else but the Spirit!"]],[3843,["But when I say something, it just goes as a big roaring,"]],[3849,["I don't know if the frequency has reached your ears or not,"]],[3853,["but I would request you now,"]],[3855,["as Gavin has asked me for Guru Nanaka's day,"]],[3859,["I really didn't want to come."]],[3861,["Because to talk of Guru Nanaka and to hear about him,"]],[3866,["one has to be a very great person."]],[3873,["Because such a light to bear, you have to make up yourself."]],[3878,["Everything else is important,"]],[3884,["then how can you talk of Sahaja Yoga coming there."]],[3892,["I went to America, I was surprised!"]],[3894,["Americans whatever it is, few people,"]],[3896,["but to them Sahaja Yoga is the most important thing."]],[3899,["They talk of nothing but Sahaja Yoga, their life is Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3902,["morning till evening they are working out Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3904,["nothing else, they are not bothered."]],[3907,["Australians you know."]],[3915,["But the Heart is not open, the Spirit has not shown its light."]],[3923,["It is the one that gives you complete satisfaction, complete joy,"]],[3932,["complete Guru's principle, because then you start giving."]],[3937,["If there is no light what are you giving? Darkness ?"]],[3941,["What are you giving to others ?"]],[3944,["The darkness that is within you, if you are going to give that...."]],[3951,["So the second phase, has to be, as I have told you, to have self respect."]],[3963,["-"]],[3967,["-"]],[3974,["-"]],[3977,["-"]],[3986,["-"]],[4000,["-"]],[4006,["-"]],[4010,["-"]],[4013,["-"]],[4020,["-"]],[4023,["-"]],[4026,["-"]],[4030,["-"]],[4032,["-"]],[4036,["-"]],[4041,["-"]],[4046,["-"]],[4049,["-"]],[4055,["-"]],[4059,["-"]],[4062,["-"]],[4065,["-"]],[4066,["-"]],[4069,["-"]],[4071,["-"]],[4077,["-"]],[4080,["-"]],[4082,["-"]],[4087,["-"]],[4089,["-"]],[4096,["-"]],[4099,["-"]],[4108,["-"]],[4112,["-"]],[4121,["-"]],[4126,["-"]],[4128,["-"]],[4134,["-"]],[4140,["-"]],[4143,["-"]],[4146,["-"]],[4148,["-"]],[4158,["-"]],[4163,["-"]],[4167,["-"]],[4170,["-"]],[4174,["-"]],[4176,["-"]],[4183,["-"]],[4185,["-"]],[4187,["-"]],[4191,["-"]],[4196,["-"]],[4201,["-"]],[4205,["-"]],[4211,["-"]],[4217,["-"]],[4226,["-"]],[4230,["-"]],[4234,["-"]],[4243,["-"]],[4249,["-"]],[4254,["-"]],[4258,["-"]],[4265,["-"]],[4267,["-"]],[4274,["-"]],[4280,["-"]],[4285,["-"]],[4290,["-"]],[4295,["-"]],[4300,["-"]],[4303,["-"]],[4305,["-"]],[4307,["-"]],[4311,["-"]],[4317,["-"]],[4320,["-"]],[4324,["-"]],[4328,["-"]],[4335,["-"]],[4338,["The one who out fishes and sells them in the market."]],[4346,["But his body is so well built and shining"]],[4349,["and the muscles so developed and the man,"]],[4352,["he stands up and the way he talks!"]],[4354,["And absolutely humble person."]],[4363,["No wonder Christ chose fishermen."]],[4366,["While he has got thousands of fishermen as his disciples,"]],[4371,["but he doesn't call them disciples,"]],[4373,["he says they are all Mother's children."]],[4375,["Thousands! You don't know."]],[4377,["He has been calling me to go to them,"]],[4379,["and all that but they come to my programme, some of them."]],[4383,["And one day I have to go down, to those islands,"]],[4386,["any one of the islands he said you come they will be all there"]],[4388,["the whole day waiting for you."]],[4390,["But the way he is there is surprising."]],[4397,["When I am there he brings fishes for me."]],[4401,["But I said, you see, I eat fishes that you bring"]],[4405,["but what about my other children."]],[4407,["He said no, next time, all the fishes will be sent to you."]],[4411,["And he sent one truck-load to me, you would not believe!"]],[4414,["I said now I don't even have truck-load of disciples,"]],[4417,["who is going to eat all this?"]],[4422,["And he said, \"Nothing, I just went and told fishermen"]],[4425,["that Mother has asked for fishes and everybody gave their fishes."]],[4428,["One day they will not have fishes,"]],[4430,["what is there, what does it matter.\""]],[4432,["Imagine those people who live day-to-day in that country."]],[4438,["Modi told the newspaper people"]],[4443,["that we can control the elements"]],[4445,["somehow by Mother's grace."]],[4447,["So the newspaper people felt they were very much boasting."]],[4451,["But it is true, they can."]],[4456,["To them it is not boasting it is just what it is they are seeing."]],[4460,["They are telling the truth, you see."]],[4463,["But that should happen."]],[4464,["We should also have some things"]],[4466,["to boast here. Important."]],[4468,["So now we have the other phase as I told you,"]],[4472,["is of becoming the Guru of yourself."]],[4483,["Detaching yourself, identifying yourself with the Spirit"]],[4487,["which is growing in its light."]],[4491,["So detachment. One has to develop detachment."]],[4496,["'My' mother, it starts like that;"]],[4498,["my mother is suffering from cancer, my father is suffering from madness,"]],[4505,["Mother can you cure them ?"]],[4509,["So now first I cure mother and father."]],[4512,["Then I'm married, my wife is like this,"]],[4515,["my child is like this then my house, then my motorcar,"]],[4524,["then my dog, then my umbrella!"]],[4530,["I have to go suddenly from A to Z, from Z to A."]],[4540,["Alright, I can do, up to a point, but for what? For what?"]],[4552,["Why to cure the mother, father, brother, sisters,"]],[4556,["every relationship, the 10th marriage and the 11th divorce ?"]],[4562,["Why to correct all this? For what?"]],[4568,["It must have some purpose, and if that purpose cannot be served,"]],[4574,["what is the use of doing it?"]],[4578,["The purpose is that you at least leave all these things in my hands"]],[4585,["and detach yourself."]],[4586,["But you want to bring the case to Me as well as worry about it."]],[4591,["Detachment."]],[4595,["But the idea of detachment is this!"]],[4599,["\"I'm very detached about money, Mother, absolutely."]],[4602,["I'm not bothered. I keep the lights on,"]],[4605,["why to worry about money ?\""]],[4609,["This is the argument,"]],[4610,["\"Why should we worry about looking after the gas and all that,"]],[4615,["after all we are detached people. We are in detachment, you see."]],[4620,["We are not attached to money.\""]],[4622,["But who is going to pay ?"]],[4626,["The other type of detachment that. I see, very interesting one is this one:"]],[4632,["\"I'm very detached, so I'm not bothered about having a bath,"]],[4640,["having all kinds of diseases,"]],[4642,["having all kinds of problems within myself,"]],[4645,["giving my problems to others. I'm detached!"]],[4648,["Why should I cover myself ? I'm detached."]],[4652,["If I get cold, I'm detached,"]],[4655,["let everybody get cold from me."]],[4658,["What can I do, I'm detached."]],[4661,["I've got cold, so what does it matter,"]],[4663,["I'm a detached personality."]],[4665,["Why should others mind?"]],[4666,["They should also get detached.\""]],[4674,["This is the ridiculous limit we can go"]],[4677,["in our idea of detachment! Detachment is from within."]],[4683,["You are not bothered. You are not bothered."]],[4692,["You know your Mother."]],[4695,["The first detachment is shown in generosity."]],[4699,["Detachment is generosity. Grezna is."]],[4710,["She sold her ornaments for nothing at all."]],[4713,["I mean I would never have accepted that money,"]],[4715,["but she just sold them. It's remarkable."]],[4719,["She sold them She is Polish not English. She sold her ornaments ;"]],[4726,["and this is what communism has done to people."]],[4728,["They are very detached,"]],[4730,["communists are very detached people I tell you."]],[4735,["Of course I would never take that money, that's theirs,"]],[4740,["but the way she did it, just like that."]],[4743,["For God's work alright what is ornaments, take it."]],[4750,["I mean you know I've given away so many of my ornaments"]],[4754,["to keep relations alright."]],[4759,["The other day I gave away my Kara to Christine,"]],[4762,["you know that when she got engaged."]],[4764,["Just it came out of the hand and went away."]],[4766,["I was detached you see, I never even felt the coming out !"]],[4773,["So much detached that Christine told me"]],[4775,["she was cramped up with pressure but to me it was just, just nothing."]],[4780,["Dust. So that detachment has to come."]],[4791,["Now you should know which part you are there."]],[4796,["Like idea of detachment should not be"]],[4801,["that - I would say hippy style of detachment,"]],[4806,["that you have right to exploit everybody else."]],[4810,["And the other type as I told you. which is very ridiculous."]],[4814,["It's not an idea, it's a thing,"]],[4817,["it's your awareness itself which is detached."]],[4828,["So, these four things for your material side is important."]],[4836,["What you eat is not so important,"]],[4842,["because whatever you eat,"]],[4843,["if the brain is going to be such a non-sensical thing"]],[4845,["it's better whether you eat it or not, makes no difference does it?"]],[4849,["Analyze it, like in the hotel, what will you have,"]],[4853,["\" I'll have pancakes,\" what will you have,"]],[4855,["\" I'll have this I'll have that\", for what ?"]],[4857,["I just don't understand why waste so much energy,"]],[4860,["why not you all have pancakes all of you put together."]],[4863,["It's a very big thing you know. Or, today I'll have this."]],[4868,["\"I\". Out of all this materialism what comes out is Mr \"I\"."]],[4877,["So we develop this Mr I."]],[4880,["So the word \"I\" must go away, we should speak \"we\"."]],[4886,["\"We\" means you and all the Sahaja Yogis put together."]],[4894,["When you say \"we\" you will find it will be different."]],[4898,["Or take your name, like \"this Norman.\""]],[4902,["\"This Norman won't listen,\" like children say."]],[4907,["I asked a little boy, will you go home ? \""]],[4911,["I will go, but this (his name was Munna) this Munna, won't go,"]],[4918,["he's very obstinate, what can I do ?\" This is detachment."]],[4929,["To speak in third person is detachment,"]],[4932,["in which you are not in the picture..."]],[4937,["you are a witness."]],[4939,["You are the witness in the show."]],[4940,["So this detachment should work in such a way"]],[4944,["that you should witness the whole show,"]],[4946,["you're not involved into it."]],[4947,["But just see what happens, in collectivity also."]],[4954,["It becomes a political issue certainly,"]],[4956,["in Sahaja Yoga also, political issue; nothing short of political issue!"]],[4961,["We are not here fighting like union leaders."]],[4969,["We are all leaders ! Where is the time to fight?"]],[4978,["Whom are we to fight , that we have to decide."]],[4982,["So, as far as all these things concerned,"]],[4986,["are detachment and attachment to Spirit."]],[4993,["So we go further,"]],[4995,["see now what should be our attitude on our mental level."]],[5001,["Physically you have seen that you have to develop"]],[5007,["a complete detachment in these four ways that I have told you."]],[5011,["Now on your mental level what you have to do,"]],[5016,["is to understand the essence of every writing,"]],[5027,["try to discriminate between Vidya and avidya."]],[5032,["Because avidya will kill you, will take away your energy,"]],[5041,["but vidya will sustain."]],[5044,["So try to find out books which are supporting vidya."]],[5050,["I was surprised, there is a lady Barbara,"]],[5053,["she met only last time Gavin,"]],[5055,["and she has written such a tremendous book, you'd be amazed!"]],[5060,["I mean of such a level on Sahaja Yoga ! Very direct."]],[5064,["I'll show you that, and you know that book is now being considered"]],[5069,["for giving her a.doctorate, can you believe it I"]],[5072,["In an American university;"]],[5074,["of course that's only possible in America."]],[5076,["But still that book has that level,"]],[5082,["I was amazed at the book!"]],[5084,["So try to gather nourishment, like reading Devi Mahatmya,"]],[5090,["reading about, finding out about Bible"]],[5093,["and finding about other scriptures, about Koran - this that,"]],[5097,["and which supports you, which nourishes you."]],[5102,["Blake, Kabir, Nanaka. I mean there are so many, Laotze."]],[5111,["This is the good - is the knowledge. But you'll be amazed,"]],[5115,["once you start doing it, it comes to you."]],[5118,["I met a man near Rahuri - as you know we go there,"]],[5128,["and there's a man who just drives a bullock cart,"]],[5132,["and he had brought the bullock cart to take me down"]],[5137,["to one of the programmes, you know what we do there."]],[5139,["And he was sitting there, we were waiting, I was talking, to him."]],[5143,["And I felt an Avadhuta is sitting there to drive me,"]],[5146,["I mean uneducated absolutely, he's never known books,"]],[5149,["he does not know how to write, but the way he was talking I said,"]],[5152,["\"Oh God, from where this knowledge!"]],[5160,["From where was all this coming, this wisdom!"]],[5163,["Such wisdom, I tell you!''"]],[5165,["Such wisdom that I was just stunned, I was stunned really!"]],[5169,["From a man who is not even been to any school-college."]],[5173,["Christ did not go to any school or college."]],[5177,["Such wisdom, you can't imagine."]],[5180,["You meet him next time when you go there."]],[5182,["If somebody could translate him... you feel like touching his feet"]],[5187,["the way - extremely unassuming simple man,"]],[5190,["wearing a white, clean topi and clean dress and driving me down."]],[5198,["And to him this was the greatest privilege of the whole world --"]],[5201,["is to drive me; he said \"It must be the greatest of all --"]],[5204,["something I must have done - to be able to drive you.\""]],[5208,["And in such simple ways he was explaining to me"]],[5212,["about the character of the bullocks and the human beings --"]],[5215,["just imagine! And the things he talked about,"]],[5219,["if I tell you, you won't believe - so I just don't know..."]],[5223,["That's the sign of a great man, he doesn't talk of frivolous things,"]],[5229,["he has no time to talk about frivolous things."]],[5231,["I have seen my own grandchildren --"]],[5233,["they never talk of frivolous things, they have no time,"]],[5235,["they are busy, you know."]],[5237,["All the time clearing out, when they came here, they said"]],[5239,["\"We have to clear out this Brompton Square,"]],[5241,["then we have to clear out this Knights bridge,"]],[5243,["then we have to clear out this London,"]],[5245,["then we have to clear out this England."]],[5246,["Where is the map of England, bring it,\""]],[5248,["all the time they were busy, you see, clearing out, and then,"]],[5251,["\"this place is this, this place is this."]],[5252,["Oh God this horrible,"]],[5254,["bring some shoes, do this do that,\""]],[5256,["all the time they were busy morning till evening."]],[5258,["They would go upstairs in the room and they are busy."]],[5261,["They are busy people, they have no time to talk"]],[5263,["of the mundane things and all that."]],[5264,["Then I brought some dolls and toys, for them."]],[5267,["They put all of them there and they put them, and the map there,"]],[5271,["\"now see now, (to dolls) now you look after, alright ?\""]],[5275,["You know they're talking to dolls like that."]],[5278,["Dolls are their disciples. Teaching the dolls,"]],[5280,["\"you see, don't sit like this, you must sit properly, you don't know."]],[5284,["You can't bend your knees ?"]],[5285,["Better learn that, you must learn to bend your knees,\""]],[5288,["because dolls have straight legs!"]],[5295,["And all the boys, even the little children,"]],[5298,["I have seen the way they are busy all the time doing Sahaja Yoga."]],[5304,["Every level they are working."]],[5309,["As today I was telling Rustom about my own father."]],[5316,["You see, he was a learned man, of course."]],[5318,["But when he talked, he used to talk of something,"]],[5322,["like I told him about the state of a person, called Sambhranta."]],[5328,["He told me that, \"Human beings are very different from God."]],[5333,["When God incarnates then the Sambhranta state,"]],[5337,["which is awakening between the subconscious"]],[5340,["to the conscious state, is direct, you see."]],[5345,["He comes down directly But human beings"]],[5348,["go this way, they never go straight."]],[5353,["See God descends, so he descends properly,"]],[5355,["but ascent is always in a very separate way."]],[5358,["It goes on like this, and he gathers everything"]],[5361,["that is in his subconscious, so the Sambhranta state,"]],[5365,["where he is waking up, is such a dangerous thing"]],[5368,["that he can gather up anything."]],[5370,["And by the time he gathers up the dreams he becomes something so funny."]],[5373,["He may look at God whom he has seen in his dream"]],[5378,["like a witch, and the witch like a bird.\""]],[5382,["I saw him always busy. I mean to talk to him,"]],[5391,["I found a companion and he found me a companion sort of a thing."]],[5395,["He could talk, because his attention was there."]],[5398,["His attention was not how every body has made their hair,"]],[5401,["and how they are sitting down or what dresses they are making,"]],[5404,["or what do you have in this thing - nothing."]],[5406,["His attention was on the Spirit, his own Spirit and Spirit of others."]],[5412,["And he was so dynamic in his brain that he knew your dictionary"]],[5420,["by heart, I tell you."]],[5421,["He never consulted dictionary all his life --"]],[5423,["neither Sanskrit nor English, and he was master of 14 languages."]],[5427,["Can you imagine! How he must have managed!"]],[5433,["He used to play tennis very well, he used to swim for 3 miles every day."]],[5437,["3 miles. He had muscles that he could just lift you up. Yes!"]],[5443,["Very healthy personality, healthy man."]],[5448,["Very generous, very generous."]],[5450,["Much more generous than me, so you can imagine."]],[5453,["Very generous, to him nothing mattered,"]],[5455,["\"alright you like it, take it\"."]],[5457,["He'll starve himself but he'll be generous."]],[5461,["And a man of principle."]],[5465,["So we come to the second point which is actually"]],[5470,["we have started the fifth one - which is mentally"]],[5473,["you must only take to things which are nourishing."]],[5482,["Through vibratory awareness you will know."]],[5484,["Ask other Sahaja Yogis, if you do not know."]],[5488,["But take nourishing things to read and not horrible,"]],[5491,["detrimental to your growth."]],[5493,["If you read them, you are responsible:"]],[5496,["You are real great readers I must say --"]],[5501,["you ask any name, everyone knows."]],[5503,["I said who was Gropius, everyone knows."]],[5505,["You need not be an academician to tell."]],[5507,["Everyone knows, what happened, who is this, who is that."]],[5510,["Out of your seeking you have done one good thing --"]],[5514,["to have read everything whether good or bad,"]],[5516,["whatever it is."]],[5518,["But now after realisation, you must try to find out"]],[5520,["what you have to read, what you have to know,"]],[5523,["it should be nourishing."]],[5524,["Talk that is nourishing, helpful."]],[5528,["So in talk you should have compassion."]],[5534,["If you are talking to someone you should be full of compassion."]],[5539,["Sahaja Yoga is a system of compassion."]],[5541,["A Guru has to be very-very patient."]],[5546,["It is not like other Gurudom,"]],[5549,["or even real Gurus had no patience."]],[5553,["This is a system where patience is the only way it will work out,"]],[5558,["because no Gurus gave realisation, it is only you"]],[5561,["who have to give it. And you know what is realisation."]],[5563,["The other day we met one; the fellow sitting tight."]],[5568,["They said, \"We have failed Mother, we can't give him realisation,"]],[5576,["it's a hopeless case\". I said, \"Really ?\""]],[5577,["So I went there - at the end of it you see, they said,"]],[5580,["\"Mother there's one fellow sitting\"."]],[5582,["I wanted to aviod, you see, but they said."]],[5585,["Alright, so raised his Kundalini, raised it up, tied it up,"]],[5591,["my hands bearing now. \"Oh no, I didn't feel anything\"."]],[5596,["I said, this fellow is least bothered"]],[5603,["how much we are working on him!"]],[5606,["He's just thinking he's obliging us.\""]],[5608,["So then two or three people came forward, brought a light,"]],[5611,["put the light before him, did bandhan here and everything:"]],[5615,["Again I raised his Kundalini thrice:"]],[5619,["\"No, not at all... ! \"it went on like that for half an hour,"]],[5624,["then I gave up. I said,"]],[5626,["\"Sir, I'm sorry, you are too great"]],[5628,["for realisation! We'll try again\"."]],[5632,["\"I'm not convinced...\" And I was fagged out,"]],[5638,["I said \"Really, I am convinced about you,"]],[5642,["so, you allow us to go\", and then I came out."]],[5644,["You have to have 'tremendous' patience and sense of humour --"]],[5647,["you just can't tell him off."]],[5649,["You see if I told him ''You are good for nothing, useless,"]],[5652,["you have a bad Kundalini you go away from here get away, get lost.\""]],[5656,["I couldn't say these things to him, I had to bear him through and not only,"]],[5663,["in the end I had to say you are a great man, you see."]],[5666,["Because otherwise he would have used some other method."]],[5669,["Because, already the ego was so big"]],[5672,["that with all the pins I put inside it, it could not deflate,"]],[5675,["it was made of a special fibre I think !"]],[5682,["It was such a difficult task."]],[5685,["So one has to know that we have to be compassionate."]],[5688,["We have to read something that nourishes our compassion."]],[5693,["Read of people who gave away everything that they had."]],[5698,["Tukarama. Read Tukarama. Tukarama was a poor man."]],[5704,["And one day he went to some place and did some good job,"]],[5709,["so they gave him lots of sugar cane."]],[5715,["His children were very fond of sugar cane."]],[5718,["So on the way every child would ask, \"give me one sugar cane\"."]],[5721,["He was giving to everyone."]],[5723,["When he came home only one was left."]],[5725,["So the children said, \"we are three\"."]],[5727,["He said, \"It's alright; next time I will bring for you,"]],[5731,["share it among you three\". And they had it,"]],[5734,["they said, \"better have it, now one more child will come"]],[5737,["and this will also go away\"."]],[5741,["So one has to know about lives who have been giving."]],[5747,["Read about people who have been giving."]],[5751,["They gave their lives. They crucified them, they tortured them."]],[5757,["They allowed to be exploited."]],[5759,["They allowed to be poisoned."]],[5761,["Head of such sacrifice, of great sacrifices."]],[5765,["We are lucky people that we have seen all those things"]],[5768,["with our own eyes."]],[5770,["But at least you be one of them, that you can at least,"]],[5773,["if not see, visualise it. You can. Bring that as your principle."]],[5779,["So we move now, from detachment,"]],[5785,["which I've told you four types of detachment,"]],[5789,["and then I told you the nourishment of your mind"]],[5796,["and nourishment to your heart."]],[5799,["Nothing nourishes more to a person than giving away."]],[5806,["Nothing nourishes your heart, your compassion,"]],[5811,["unless and until you learn to give away."]],[5813,["Now will you please make a list of things,"]],[5816,["\"how many things you have given away in this one year, last one year\"."]],[5822,["I can't because it is too much."]],[5826,["Please make a list of things, \"how many things\","]],[5830,["except for your brains you have given away to others"]],[5835,["without thinking about it, or have thought of giving."]],[5845,["Since Christmas let us say, to this Christmas."]],[5854,["Heart is opening. Think of giving."]],[5864,["On material level, other help is there to give."]],[5870,["But no, we don't even give the other help,"]],[5875,["for which you don't have to spend any money."]],[5878,["Just give a hand."]],[5880,["I have seen, very easy to make out,"]],[5885,["labour saving devices."]],[5889,["Now, I have come here, some will be running,"]],[5893,["others are just sitting."]],[5895,["Tea is brought to them, food is brought of them everything is done."]],[5899,["They'll just put the plate also before: go and wash."]],[5908,["Its not only selfishness but it is unmannerly, unmannerly to be like this."]],[5918,["In Sahaja Yoga you have to be"]],[5925,["extremely busy helping others,"]],[5930,["at every point. To be helpful."]],[5935,["You know Ravi Shankar's Guru was a very great,"]],[5939,["a very great man, a realized soul. He was a great person."]],[5944,["So he knew so many things."]],[5946,["And one day I was there, in the night you see, there was a doctor,"]],[5952,["we were his guests in a way, for dinner we had gone there."]],[5957,["In the night the call came that,"]],[5958,["\"I need you very much\" to the doctor."]],[5961,["The doctor said, \"Now I'm tired\"."]],[5962,["He was another very giving person, no doubt."]],[5964,["He said, \"Oh you must come, I have a big problem."]],[5967,["See I saw a little baby.\""]],[5971,["He said, \"What baby have you found ?\""]],[5973,["He said, \"its a baby,\" he was an old man,"]],[5976,["he said, \"I found a baby of a deer which is suffering now,"]],[5981,["and the mother is dead and nobody is to look after it.\""]],[5985,["So I said \"Alright I'll also come with you\","]],[5989,["because I knew I will touch the baby. I went with him."]],[5992,["So, he was sitting with the little thing near his heart."]],[6000,["So the doctor said, \"What are you doing ?\""]],[6003,["He said, \"I'm trying to give him my life if possible,"]],[6007,["so that when you come at least you find him alive\"."]],[6010,["Just like this, just love."]],[6012,["So he took out the thing - doctor - his coat and all that,"]],[6018,["and he said, \"alright put it down\"."]],[6020,["He put it down very cautiously."]],[6022,["I mean he was a realized soul, no doubt."]],[6024,["I put my hand on the thing and it came to life,"]],[6028,["and it started, alright, he was very happy."]],[6030,["He said, \"You are a Devi, you are a Goddess, I can tell you."]],[6035,["But one bad thing you have done.\" I said \"What ? \""]],[6037,["You are married.\" I said, \"But Devis must marry, also.\""]],[6041,["He said, \"No, supposing you have married a miserly man,"]],[6044,["then what will happen to you ?\""]],[6045,["I said, \"I will see to it that, I don't marry a miserly man."]],[6050,["That would be the greatest curse.\""]],[6053,["He said, \"I had the same type of a wife who was miserly,"]],[6056,["and I got fed up with her for her miserliness.\""]],[6059,["So that is what it is : miserliness should be hated,"]],[6063,["absolutely to be hated, absolutely to be the worst of all."]],[6069,["It's like leprosy for Sahaja Yogis. Miserliness."]],[6073,["It's saving saving pounds, you know."]],[6078,["That must go away from your mind,"]],[6083,["Miserliness to yourself is good, miserliness to others is bad."]],[6088,["Gregoire told me a shocking thing."]],[6091,["He said, \"this is our culture.\""]],[6093,["I said \"Your culture ! what is it ?\""]],[6095,["You see, he said that \"if we go in a hotel, and if somebody is paying,"]],[6099,["we start looking this side and that.\""]],[6101,["I said, \"Really !\". He said, that is very common."]],[6109,["I just cannot believe it ! This is culture!"]],[6111,["It is the opposite of culture. Whatever you may call it,"]],[6114,["it's not culture at all. Culture would be to come forward,"]],[6118,["\"Alright I'll pay\". But Americans are even worse, they'll say,"]],[6121,["\"I paid for you yesterday, you pay today for me.\""]],[6126,["It's absolutely disgraceful miserliness."]],[6130,["But this is gracious; you see when somebody is paying,"]],[6134,["you look on the other side. It may be gracious, I don't know,"]],[6138,["whatever it is, it's just the same ; filth I tell you."]],[6143,["So compassion ; compassion at any point."]],[6146,["You may have to work till 2 o'clock, you may ."]],[6148,["have to work at 4 o'clock, doesn't matter."]],[6150,["You have to work, you have to work, you have to work;"]],[6152,["because compassion itself is joy giving,"]],[6156,["because your Spirit is the Ocean of Compassion."]],[6161,["There is no other way, there is no other way"]],[6167,["to enjoy your Spirit but to Give, to Give, to Give."]],[6172,["Doesn't matter if you have not eaten your food, doesn't matter."]],[6174,["Nothing matters."]],[6179,["Many a times a you know that I don't have food for 24 hours sometimes,"]],[6185,["still I am giving."]],[6186,["Its not necessary for this body to eat,"]],[6189,["the food of this body is compassion. That nourishes."]],[6196,["So you have to be miserly towards yourself,"]],[6199,["but you must have compassion."]],[6202,["Heart, open your heart."]],[6206,["Open your heart first of all, for thankfulness."]],[6214,["This is the other quality one should have."]],[6218,["It's a higher quality I should say, of thankfulness to God."]],[6222,["He has given you realization. He has given you this body."]],[6225,["Do you realize that this body,"]],[6227,["human body He has given to you."]],[6229,["He has given you everything. Count your blessings."]],[6232,["Even to have the morning, to enjoy it as a human being."]],[6238,["You are not in any bandhan, you are not in any pasha,"]],[6241,["you are not pashus, you are not animals."]],[6244,["Animals are pashus."]],[6245,["You are free people, God has given you freedom."]],[6249,["And he has given you His realization. Sense of thankfulness."]],[6255,["But our language is such, \"thank you, thank you, thank you,\" finished."]],[6259,["It is only in the lips, it finishes; lipservice."]],[6263,["From your heart thank Him, from your heart."]],[6270,["Not outside just go to church, \"thank you. God very much,\""]],[6274,["alright done, finished."]],[6280,["It's to thank Him from your heart, write praise. Praise."]],[6291,["Sing praise, \"glory to God.\" to the great who has created us."]],[6300,["Your disciples are sitting and every moment"]],[6304,["when you are talking you are thinking about Mother or about God."]],[6308,["You'll be amazed! It's only possible if you have sensitivity,"]],[6317,["if you have memory. The greatest miracle of this world"]],[6326,["is that everybody has to die and nobody remembers it."]],[6331,["But another one, is that everybody is blessed by God"]],[6335,["but nobody knows it."]],[6337,["But you are so specially blessed."]],[6347,["So what you should do ?"]],[6351,["Be in joy, be grateful, so that bliss comes to you."]],[6360,["Without thankfulness nothing is going to work out."]],[6364,["Thankful heart."]],[6367,["You need a heart that is thankful to God so that he gives you."]],[6372,["When you give others he will definitely give."]],[6375,["But don't think it is your own."]],[6380,["You are giving what God has given you."]],[6386,["So today I have told you 8-fold movement."]],[6392,["So you have become half moon, only in mind."]],[6397,["And the other half, keep it for the next 'Guru Purnima'. Alright ?"]],[6404,["MAY GOD BLESS YOU"]]]);
